WEBVTT

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:11.180
The presence of Belcross has...

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:12.350
...disappeared.

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:13.270
What?

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:14.980
You've got to be kidding!

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.270
As if it disappeared from this universe...

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.980
So Age is...

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:26.660
Let's go help him! No one
on this ship will oppose that!

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:35.410
He will come... He promised that.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:43.710
<b>Over and over again I wish on the dazzling star far away</b>

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:49.970
<b>Wandering heartbeats, gravitation, the story of their attraction</b>

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:10.120
<b>When did it begin? No one knows the end of it</b>

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:17.120
<b>It's not a trick or an illusion, it's a current that I can't swim against</b>

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.120
<b>(Dark!)</b>

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:24.130
<b>The monster that lives in the darkness</b>

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:25.960
<b>(Blight!)</b>

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:29.590
<b>As if I were easily getting swallowed into it</b>

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:31.220
<b>(I seek a hero!)</b>

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.850
<b>I awake as I truly am</b>

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:42.690
<b>If God says conflicts and life's old dreams go hand in hand</b>

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:47.900
<b>I'm looking for you even if it means ripping my body apart</b>

00:01:47.990 --> 00:01:51.280
<b>With a flower held to my heart,</b>

00:01:51.370 --> 00:01:56.580
<b>no one can stop this heartbeat now that it's begun</b>

00:01:56.660 --> 00:02:00.620
<b>We're destined to come in contact</b>

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:12.260
All warping processes have completed.

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:14.720
Check our surroundings and coordinates.

00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:18.100
We're unable to verify them.
They're not available in our database.

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:21.440
Have all monitoring and observation
devices running at their maximum capacity!

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:25.570
Do not overlook any slight abnormal change!
Unknown territory lies ahead of us.

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:28.110
I will look for the path.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:37.740
Elysium... A planet with no starway.

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:41.870
If we can't find it, we'll be
forced to drift about forever.

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:45.000
But this is the same as the Olone incident.

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:48.420
Even on this journey full of unknowns,
as long as we have the princess' guidance,

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:50.720
we have nothing to be afraid of!

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:53.800
Age...

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:59.810
To the mother planet of
the Tribe of Gold: Elysium...

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:04.150
That is what we must accomplish right now.

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:17.450
Why did the Nodos disappear?

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:23.620
What our Nodos' agreements have in
common is to save the life of Yuty La.

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:28.170
Her Kervius has destroyed four Nodos,
including the Tribe of Iron's Nodos.

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:32.630
The Tribe of Iron's Nodos
wasn't intimidating to Kervius.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:38.640
What if being destroyed is a way to
protect Kervius, in other words, Yuty La?

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:41.100
That is consistent with the agreements.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:44.980
Nothing connects the Tribe of Silver
and the Tribe of Gold now.

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:47.810
Is this also the intention of the Tribe of Gold?

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:50.400
Does this mean that Rom Ror is right?

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:54.740
It may be necessary to
rethink the Elysium plan.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:14.380
No one is here. No one...

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:17.930
I'm the only Nodos left...

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:22.060
Karkinos... For me he...

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:35.950
I think I'm going to lose it if I don't
hand over this emotion to Prome...

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:41.490
Hurry up and erase it...
Erase this... Erase this emotion!

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:47.710
Why, Rom Ror?

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:51.500
Why do you confine me?

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:55.170
I can't entrust you to Prome right now.

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:59.680
I can't afford to let Prome steal you.

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:02.720
No...

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:08.100
I must be the one to control you.

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:11.230
Help me...

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:16.490
You must obey your agreements.

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:25.450
Why did you come back, Mehitak?

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:31.340
I can no longer jump,
even with Erymanthos' power...

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:33.090
Forgive me.

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:40.930
Lecty.

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:42.640
Mehitak.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:43.600
I...

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:48.520
Finally I've been truly released.

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:55.190
It's quiet.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:58.610
We were thrown into
nothingness because of Kervius.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:03.580
Erymanthos is just barely maintaining
space and time right now, but eventually...

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:15.920
A-Age!

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:18.670
Thanks!

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:20.010
What?

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:21.220
This place!

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:24.970
It only means that we get
to survive just a little longer.

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:26.720
It's okay!

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:30.770
Age...

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:38.650
That's the Corba and the Irazil fleet.

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:43.700
This is all that survived out
of the two fleets combined?

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:49.120
Just how many ships will
be able make it to Codomos?

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:52.620
Picking up an energy source believed
to be an enemy convoy on our course!

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:53.540
Ma'am.

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:55.130
Change course.

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:58.760
Leave Alta star system for now, then
take a detour in the non-combat zone.

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:02.380
After that, return to the
Codomos starway once again.

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:05.350
Send the location of the enemy's
convoy to all the fleets.

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:09.600
Avoid battle as much as possible.
We will reorganize the fleet at Codomos.

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:12.230
We received data from the Argonaut.

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:14.520
Play it.

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:20.320
We feel that we need to learn more about you.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:23.610
My thoughts are the same.

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:28.030
Are you here by yourself?
 What...

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.580
The star of brilliance...

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:33.920
She never stops giving us hopes.

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:39.880
Ancient planet Elysium...

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:43.930
Please, please show us the way.

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:52.140
All I can do is just watch over her like this.

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:57.690
I can imagine how encouraging it would be
for Dhianeila-sama if Age were here right now.

00:07:57.770 --> 00:08:00.070
Because you're here to support her,

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:02.360
she can focus on trying to find the way

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:05.070
without worrying about
physical and mental weariness.

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:09.490
Wow, it sure is unusual
for you to be extra nice to me.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:17.250
Dhianeila-sama was saying that Age
had disappeared from the universe...

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.920
There's no way Age would
be taken down that easily.

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:25.800
Especially not after he made
a promise with the princess.

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:27.550
I'm sure he'll be back.

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:32.100
Just like he always has, he'll come back.

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:38.270
Right.

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:43.610
Age heard Dhianeila's
voice before he came here.

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:45.320
What did she say?

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:49.320
We have to go where Dhianeila is going.

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:51.540
But it's impossible to get out of here.

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:54.040
Now that we've all
exhausted our powers in battle,

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:58.830
trying to get out of here
would only shorten our lives.

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:02.460
One, two, three, four.

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:04.420
It'll be okay, because there are four.

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:05.670
Four?

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:09.640
Wh-What is it?

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:14.890
Lernaea.

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:17.020
Is alive?

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:24.530
What is this?

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:39.710
Lernaea's regenerating power...
I didn't know it was this powerful...

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:47.880
Karkinos!

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:51.930
Four!

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:55.970
Astral turbine is ready to activate!

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:58.730
All we need now are the
coordinates of the destination.

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:00.690
We'll stand by as we are.

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:04.020
As soon as we receive an instruction
from the princess, we'll enter active warp.

00:10:04.110 --> 00:10:05.610
Yes, Master.

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:13.160
Princess...

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:16.540
Enemy convoy detected in direction 02-48.

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.580
Prepare to counterattack!

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:22.710
Distance 2894. Organ unit
is ready for emergency launch.

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:24.840
Link to the attack program!

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:38.430
Hurry up!

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:39.770
Oh, no!

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:44.230
You're late!
 I know, I know.

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:46.900
No error detected in
the firearms control system.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:51.490
Oboronas will establish a
defensive line against the enemy.

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:54.490
This must be the faction
that despises humanity, huh?

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:05.250
Oboronas are now in position!

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:07.750
Each barbette is ready to fire!

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:17.100
Multiple gravitational disturbances detected!

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:19.310
What? New enemies?

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:22.350
Projecting.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:26.270
Open a path!

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:29.650
You must not interrupt the voyage of that ship.

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:32.400
That is our collective will.

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:36.450
I will prove whether
Prome's thinking is right or not!

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:37.740
That's unnecessary.

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:39.410
We'll find out sooner or later.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:43.120
If the ship is the one
that the Tribe of Gold foresaw,

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:47.290
it will never be destroyed anyway. Move!

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:50.340
Phaetho O's suggestion makes sense.

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:52.090
It's an unnecessary war.

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:56.640
There's no guarantee that the
power of the Tribe of Gold is left there.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:12:00.470
Whether the planet called Elysium
really exists or not is also unclear.

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:03.440
Do you mean that Prome's theory has failed?

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:05.560
That would be the case
if the assumption collapsed.

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:10.820
Prome is looking at the possibility.
Therefore, she's given the Tribe of Iron time.

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:16.360
There's no need to wait!
If Prome were right, I would perish here!

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:20.660
That is foolish thinking, Phaetho O.

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.040
Prome...

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:27.710
Move out of there! If you don't...

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:35.930
Phaetho...

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:51.480
It feels good.

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:54.400
This is the true power of Lernaea...?

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:56.950
Not the poison that kills everything,

00:12:57.030 --> 00:12:59.660
but this power...

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:03.450
Karkinos certainly died once.

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:08.630
Do you think this is also the intention of the
Tribe of Gold, just like the agreement says?

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:13.880
Belcross and the others don't have hearts.
That's why they destroyed many planets.

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:18.890
Age and the others joined them
to teach them how to have hearts.

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:24.060
So Lernaea saved some strength for Karkinos?

00:13:24.140 --> 00:13:30.480
Not to fight, but to live with Karkinos?

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:31.860
Karkinos.

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:36.690
Mehitak...

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:43.790
No more beating up on each other.

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:49.080
Although you beat me up with no questions
asked when I tried to reach out to you.

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:54.630
You sure are a selfish man.

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:03.930
Supposedly, Lernaea
saved some strength for you.

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:05.100
Yeah.

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:06.930
So you knew about it?

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:11.600
No, but Lernaea was trying to
avoid madness much more than I was,

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:14.900
just watching over me the whole time...

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:16.570
That's what I think.

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:19.530
Is this Kervius' non-dimension?

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:22.370
Just like Age said,
this makes four of us, but...

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:26.450
It's still hard to believe
there's a way to escape from here.

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:29.620
The existence of this world itself is unclear.

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:35.040
Our so-called power may
not be as powerful as we think.

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:38.630
But what Dad and the others said is still left.

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:39.720
What?

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:44.800
The Tribe of Gold told Age about the future.

00:14:44.890 --> 00:14:52.230
They combined Age and the others with
Belcross and the Heroes, to give them hearts.

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:55.360
Because when you have no heart,
you don't get to have a future.

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.030
Future...

00:14:57.110 --> 00:15:01.070
It's true that all of us
here still have agreements.

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:04.990
Karkinos will be released
when the Tribe of Silver obtains

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:06.740
the power of the Tribe of Gold.

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:12.580
Mehitak must save Yuty
when her life is in danger.

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:15.080
I also must save Yuty.

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:18.380
And when I discover the
power of the Tribe of Gold,

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:20.550
I must let the Tribe of Silver

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:24.510
know about it, and when its
power is vanishing, I must protect it.

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:26.350
For Age...

00:15:26.430 --> 00:15:29.680
For me, when everything is done,
my planet will go back to normal.

00:15:29.770 --> 00:15:30.890
Planet?

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:33.940
Olone. It's really a beautiful planet.

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:41.860
If the future was really suggested by the
Tribe of Gold through the Nodos' agreements,

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:43.570
why are there some terms which are

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:46.870
beneficial to the Silver and
others to the Tribe of Iron?

00:15:46.950 --> 00:15:53.040
That must have some kind of meaning.
We're just not ready to decode it.

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:55.540
Once we leave, we have to go rescue that girl.

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:56.920
"That girl"?

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:00.420
Let's see...

00:16:04.300 --> 00:16:06.680
Who's that?

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:08.720
The girl who put us in here.

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:10.220
Yuty!

00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:12.770
Rescue? Yuty?

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:15.600
Yup. With the four of us, it'll be no problem.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:29.740
Give this emotion to Prome...
Release me from this confinement....

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:34.910
Rom Ror, don't block me off...

00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:49.800
Why did you abandon us, Tribe of Gold? Why?

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:01.360
I will not forgive you, Rom Ror...

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:04.030
I will not forgive you....

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:09.200
Help me, Karkinos.

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:13.290
What do you mean, "with the
four of us it'll be no problem"?

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:14.660
Light.

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:15.710
Life.

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:16.870
Time.

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:18.670
Our abilities as the Nodos?

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:20.130
How about Belcross?

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:25.630
Being. Existence that can't
be lost by any kind of power.

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:30.720
We three will use our powers to open up
a point in this suspended time and space,

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:34.470
and you'll make Belcross exist. Is that right?

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:37.520
Uh-huh! Huh?

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:39.900
Which one is it?

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:43.480
I'd bet he thinks we should give it
a try as you just described, Lecty.

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:45.230
Give it a try?

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:48.820
But if we fail once, all of us
will literally return to nothingness.

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:53.240
But that's exactly what's going to
happen even if we don't do anything.

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:56.160
Are you sure about this? If we fail...

00:17:56.250 --> 00:18:03.090
It'll be fine, because I believe in Lecty-san
and the other Lecty-san inside of Lecty-san!

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:11.680
Erymanthos... That's the name
of the Hero I possess within me.

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:13.050
Okay!

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:21.730
The enemy convoy will reach the
first defensive line momentarily.

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:24.480
We didn't make it...

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:26.610
We will counterattack while
we're still in warp position!

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:28.360
Remember, we can't use the shield!

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:30.360
I expect you to have faith
in the princess' guidance

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:34.080
and do your best to protect the Argonaut!

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:35.660
Begin attacking!

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:39.000
I won't even let them
lay a finger on the Argonaut!

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:45.670
We will stop the enemy
no matter what, Princess.

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:47.300
The rest is...

00:18:49.300 --> 00:18:54.390
Erymanthos will take Belcross and
go back as far as possible in the past.

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.220
Artemia.

00:18:56.310 --> 00:19:00.100
Artemia will create waves
in a single point of the present.

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:03.730
The first direction in nothingness,
in other words, a space.

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:07.780
Lernaea, maintain everyone's life.

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:10.900
Lernaea will keep all of us alive until Belcross

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:15.910
becomes the first presence
in that time and space.

00:19:15.990 --> 00:19:17.950
Everything will happen in a split second.

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:27.090
Let's jump, Erymanthos,
for all our lives are worth.

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:43.000
Mail!
 Yeah.

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:47.170
What's going on with the Organ Schueller unit?

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:48.920
We're getting no response from them!

00:20:52.760 --> 00:20:57.510
I can't stop the war
unless I find the new path.

00:20:57.590 --> 00:21:01.560
Please... Please show me the way, Elysium!

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:03.810
Hang in there no matter what!

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:26.080
Please!

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:30.880
There it is!

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:35.550
We received the coordinates of the
planet Elysium through the psycholine!

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:38.220
All Organ units, return to the ship immediately!

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:42.350
The princess has shown us the way.
Return to the Argonaut at once!

00:21:42.430 --> 00:21:45.430
Dandelion unit, come with me to
support the damaged aircrafts!

00:21:45.520 --> 00:21:48.060
Orchid unit, hurry up and
pick up all the escape pods!

00:21:48.150 --> 00:21:50.310
I won't let you get away.

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:07.960
Warp in!

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:10.460
Age...

00:22:25.220 --> 00:22:33.440
Although I have known you for a long time

00:22:33.520 --> 00:22:40.820
I never dreamed these feelings would sprout

00:22:40.910 --> 00:22:45.950
And I would fall in love with you

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:56.710
Casually going home,
as I look at the stars in the night sky

00:22:56.800 --> 00:23:09.560
I take the long way on purpose
and lean on your shoulder as we walk

00:23:09.640 --> 00:23:20.780
You tell me you think we can overcome
anything as long as we stay together

00:23:20.860 --> 00:23:26.030
I think as I look into your forthright eyes

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:32.670
That I love you

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:40.130
When Dhianeila's wish
gets through, the planet appears.

00:23:40.220 --> 00:23:44.720
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 24: "Elysium."
